    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p>Audio Enhancers increase the sensitivity of a Droid's aural sensors, enabling it to pick up sounds not normally perceived by standard sensors. When <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Eavesdropping\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eavesdropping\">Eavesdropping</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Listening\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Listening\">Listening</a> for distant and ambient sounds, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> equipped with Audio Enhancers can reroll <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks, keeping the better of the two results. All other modifiers for the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check still apply.</p>",
    "source": "Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids",
